Subject: [PATCH 01/11] houji: define the YAAP Android 17 product

Keep the CN stock kernel and vendor baseline while selecting YAAP system components, Aperture overlays, and OpenEUICC.
Drop the Global-only Google eUICC policy overlay and use the actual YAAP build fingerprint.
